-  constructor
-  · rintro ⟨⟨C,Ω⟩,he⟩
-    exact ⟨C,C.property,Ω,Ω.property,he⟩
-  · rintro ⟨C,hC,Ω,hΩ,he⟩
-    exact ⟨(⟨C,hC⟩,⟨Ω,hΩ⟩),he⟩
-
-end GS.UnitaryGeometry
