-      unitCayley (t • (a • (minimumNormLift right left X Z).2.val)) =
-    unitCayley ((t * a) • (minimumNormLift right left X Z).1.val) * X *
-      unitCayley ((t * a) • (minimumNormLift right left X Z).2.val)
-  simp only [smul_smul]
-
-/-- Feasibility holds for all times, not only for a sufficiently small step. -/
